the &quot;under <i>pillaged</i>&quot; by Pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, that term is meant for internal use only <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T10:47:07-08:00","id":338171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> St Nick is a Changeling, maybe, he is Santa while Seelie and Krumpas when Unseelie. </div> </div> </div>Santa is more likely a spirit formed from expectations and belief of people, not unlike Uncle Sam who represents American Dream. Which means you can probably take him as a totem or bargain with him in return for certain services performed on his behalf.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T11:09:21-08:00","id":339230,"title":"","content":"Santa may or may not exist in my WoD, though if he does likely it's as a Chimerae, but Krumpas definately does as an Unseelie Satyr.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T12:37:04-08:00","id":339334,"title":"","content":"In the World of Darkness, I'd think the truth of Santa Claus would be like from <i>Buffy the Vampire Slayer</i>: been around since the 1500s, flying reindeer, comes down the chimney to disembowel children.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T18:45:53-08:00","id":339638,"title":"","content":"Only those bad ones, I presume, otherwise it's not Santa anymore.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T06:53:07-08:00","id":343856,"title":"","content":"Here's an amusing W:TA x-mas pic for you all...<br /> <a href=\"http://s1303.photobucket.com/user/Carrie_Kube/media/144544_zps92138cdd.jpg.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1303.photobucket.com/albums/ag149/Carrie_Kube/144544_zps92138cdd.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T07:40:59-08:00","id":343903,"title":"","content":"I remember doing a &quot;Demon the Fallen Christmas Special&quot; where Santa was a Malefactor that used the Lore of the Forge to make toys and the Lore of Paths to travel around the world and has access to massive amounts of Faith because, you know, he's Santa.<br /> <br /> The players were enlisted by another demon with a grudge with Santa that asked them to do all kind of &quot;naughty&quot; actions, like cutting the city Christmas tree or stealing the presents from an orphanage as a part of a ritual to learn Santa's True Name.It turned out he was just nuts and the ritual did not worked at all, but Santa came anyways and kicked their butt. Good times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 12-18-2014, 10:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T18:15:12-08:00","id":344285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/335561-christmas-on-the-world-of-darkness?p=339638#post339638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Only those bad ones, I presume, otherwise it's not Santa anymore.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It all depends on whose definition of &quot;naughty&quot; you use...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T17:12:34-08:00","id":346241,"title":"","content":"Santa is real. No one knows what he is. All attempts of the Technocracy to destroy him failed and resulted in a horrible paradox backlash.<br /> <br /> Of course this is the World of Darkness. So the list of naughty children is far longer than the list of nice children. The result: Parents replace the coal delivered by Santa with presents so their brats don't start a tantrum.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3117-lucius","name":"Lucius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T19:01:49-08:00","id":347936,"title":"","content":"Hows this -<br /> <br /> The Prince is concerned about a series of mysterious break ins at warehouses in the city. The local Amazon and UPS hubs in particular were cleaned out of toys and consumer electronics in ridiculously massive quantities that are difficult to explain, especially when you consider the professional security involved. The prince worries that some kindred is edging close to a masquerade breach, as well as the fact that the Prince has sketchy things going down in the warehouse district, so he doesn't want the police nosing around down there. They players are tasked with finding out what's going on and putting a stop to it.<br /> <br /> What's actually going down. A Malkavian Methuselah that everyone thinks has been in torpor since the 40s has actually been planning the greatest prank yet. He kidnapped a beloved Macy's Santa, embraced him and brainwashed him to believing he really is Santa. The Methuselah's spent the last 70 years, teaching him an exhaustive list of disciplines so that he carry out his mission of delivering gifts to all the children of the city during the 12 days of Christmas. This is the year that Santa rides for the first time! Anyone who tries to stop him will be judged naughty and dealt with accordingly (picture Robo Santa from Futurama).<br /> <br /> The characters have to kill Santa (a kindly old man) and ruin Christmas for tens of thousands of children or the Masquerade will be blown wide open.<br /> <br /> Santa - 6th generation Malkavian<br /> <br /> Animalism 6 - Species Speech, talks to all his reindeer at once<br /> Auspex 5 - Uses Astral Projection to find out who's naughty and nice<br /> Obfuscate 5 - Cloak the Gathering (Him, his sleigh and ghouled reindeer)<br /> Potence 5 - Needs to carry a ridiculously heavy sack<br /> Presence 3 - Who doesn't love Santa<br /> Temporis 7 - Santa is often portrayed as being able to slow time to carry out all his deliveries Thaumaturgy 5 - Uses Movement of the Mind to fly his sled<br /> <br /> Is there a Thaum path to open locked doors? If not he'll need Protean five to mist in under window cracks and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2078,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","user":"Alucard","date":". 12-22-2014, 10:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T06:29:41-08:00","id":348223,"title":"","content":"It's Yule for us, so the Changelings exchanged our crafted items and filmed it: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uWOqX4D9vkE\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uWOqX4D9vkE</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T06:58:16-08:00","id":348247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Santa is real. No one knows what he is. All attempts of the Technocracy to destroy him failed and resulted in a horrible paradox backlash. </div> </div> </div>The twist would be that Santa is real and works for Syndicate. See how his image is commercialized and what positive effect he has to bolster economy through increased consumerism.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T09:10:11-08:00","id":348367,"title":"","content":"I ran a game a couple years back and we got to play VtM on Xmas Eve. So I quietly put aside any plans for that evening and ran what would be known as Vampires Save Xmas. Involved some crazy stuff and a Tzimisce and some Technocrats who kidnapped Santa Claus. Was great fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T18:29:04-08:00","id":351152,"title":"","content":"oh the Salubri clanbook, its worth noting as it has a Description of christmas going on around the charachters in the intro fiction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i